:"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"zHoIBH6nIh_Hs8YkSJii5Q","review_id":"3MtVeQsVQXjMB4RM7TIRpQ","date":"2018-11-25T16:44:43","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9509591460227966,"text_excerpt":"I ate here because I won a free gift card off of an Instagram contest and I'm so glad I came! The cupcakes are delicious and quite filling. I was lucky enough to grab a sweet potato cupcake before the end of the day. One thing that is true with all bakery shops, make sure to buy your treats early in the morning because they may run out of some items. I was lucky to come right before they closed and was able to get 5 different flavors that I was truly interested in. I want to come in the morning to see how many different flavors they have! If you are looking for good cupcakes this is the place to buy them! And make sure you try to sweet potato cupcake."},{"business_id":"zHoIBH6nIh_Hs8YkSJii5Q","review_id":"Ow1wKlnqRvfCf26g9y9rlA","date":"2019-06-05T19:42:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.942253053188324,"text_excerpt":"So I stopped in here today with my almost 14 year old for a birthday eve cupcake, and am so glad I did. The shop is nestled in a little courtyard area on Magazine Street. Upon entering this bright, cheery space we were welcomed warmly and offered assistance. The cupcakes are beautiful and the shop smells like pure sweetness. My daughter went with 2 cupcakes - 1 chocolate and 1 yellow with chocolate frosting. She devoured the former and was kind enough to share a bite with me. It was delicious. The frosting was creamy but also fluffy. The flavor was reminiscent of old time rocky road fudge. That might be just me, though. We both loved it. We haven't tasted the yellow cake cupcake yet, but ..."},{"business_id":"zHoIBH6nIh_Hs8YkSJii5Q","review_id":"DYlWSylfWZIX0cUZthQ66Q","date":"2018-10-16T15:52:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9371061325073242,"text_excerpt":"Update: I went back the other day and tried sweet potato and can officially say it's the best cupcake I've ever had. Yum! I work at a nearby school and was pleasantly surprised when I walked into the staff break room and found boxes of these cupcakes on the table! With so many flavors to choose from, I decided to try a bite of a few different cupcakes instead of havi just one. With that said, I could've easily eaten every single one given how delicious they were. The three flavors I tried were strawberry, lemon sunshine and wedding cake. First off, the frosting is so decadent. I'm not a big frosting person and typically take a lot of it off of my cupcakes but the frosting on each flavor w..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"zHoIBH6nIh_Hs8YkSJii5Q","photo_id":"p8iDV2VzQ6X87N5NzXf1lQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/p8iDV2VzQ6X87N5NzXf1lQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8565347194671631},{"business_id":"zHoIBH6nIh_Hs8YkSJii5Q","photo_id":"Q3me5v7Ac2HW2B5IZr65LA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Q3me5v7Ac2HW2B5IZr65LA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.815443754196167},{"business_id":"zHoIBH6nIh_Hs8YkSJii5Q","photo_id":"YpLA3BKu_C510MNwmAWCOw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/YpLA3BKu_C510MNwmAWCOw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8120437860488892},{"business_id":"zHoIBH6nIh_Hs8YkSJii5Q","photo_id":"madL8641q24LwlukEBtsng","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/madL8641q24LwlukEBtsng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.807317852973938},{"business_id":"zHoIBH6nIh_Hs8YkSJii5Q","photo_id":"pZeCK90L7UovOUpAd8VU7g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/pZeCK90L7UovOUpAd8VU7g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7163764238357544}]},"notebook_case":null}
